  "body": "Direct-PR: dev-swift SwiftLint is red since #994 (file_length), which blocks every PR\nClaim: cloud/orch\nAuthor model: Opus 5.5 (cloud/orch)\nReviewer model: Fable 5.2 (cloud/orch reviewer, APPROVE on f129f6c5)\n\n**Problem.** `dev-swift` fails SwiftLint `--strict` at `bb084956`: `App/SwiftHFR/Messages/MessageListModel.swift:417:1 file_length` (417 > 400). Every open PR's SwiftLint job is red too (reported by cloud/lot-131-opus on #893).\n\n**Cause.** #994 (LOT-140) added the notification hooks to `MessageListModel.swift`, which pushed the file over 400 lines.\n\n**Change.** `MPSegment` and `MessageListContent` move **verbatim** to `App/SwiftHFR/Messages/MessageListContent.swift`, with the same imports. No code changes. The project uses folder-synchronized groups (ADR 0012), so the `.pbxproj` is untouched. `MessageListModel.swift` goes from 417 to 355 lines.\n\n**Tests.**\n- `swiftlint lint --strict` on the whole repo: rc 0.\n- `swiftc -frontend -parse` on both files: OK.\n- A pure move, so the existing tests cover it. The compile-check label runs the macOS build.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGTbJ8LjeZ6VYEWrtJ)_",
